<%# locals: () %>
<%# The selection row (doc/ticket_bulk_edit_plan.md, D2; designer template 29a):
    it takes the filter sentence's place while something is ticked. Both rows
    are information about the same list, the sentence says what is in it, this
    row what the reader touched, so they share one place and nothing jumps.
    Information only: the count, the second step to every hit, and the way out.
    No quick actions here, ever: once every change is confirmed in the lane, a
    dropdown in this row would be a second path with another meaning.
    Shown and filled by ticket_selection_controller.js; the classes are the
    sentence's own, so the two rows read as one line in two states. %>
<div hidden data-ticket-selection-target="row" aria-live="polite">
  <p class="<%= NeoFilterBarComponent::SENTENCE_PROSE_CLASSES %> flex items-center gap-3 max-w-none pe-3">
    <span class="font-semibold text-heading whitespace-nowrap" data-ticket-selection-target="count"></span>
    <%# The second step (29a): the head box took the loaded page, this takes
        every hit of the address. Appears only once the page is full and there
        is more; above the cap it stays, disabled, with the reason beside it. %>
    <button type="button" hidden
            data-ticket-selection-target="all"
            data-action="click->ticket-selection#selectAll"
            class="<%= NeoFilterBarComponent::TEXT_ACTION_CLASSES %> whitespace-nowrap disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:no-underline"></button>
    <span hidden data-ticket-selection-target="allReason" class="text-xs text-muted whitespace-nowrap"></span>
    <button type="button"
            data-action="click->ticket-selection#clear"
            class="<%= NeoFilterBarComponent::TEXT_ACTION_CLASSES %> ms-auto whitespace-nowrap"><%= t('views.organisations.tickets.selection.clear') %></button>
  </p>
</div>
<%# The result line of a run lands here (slice 6), under the selection row,
    and stays until the selection changes or lapses. %>
<div id="ticket-selection-result" data-ticket-selection-target="result" aria-live="polite"></div>
<%# The one sentence the row says when the list changed under a selection
    (D14): what was selected is no longer certain, so it was dropped.
    ⚠️ The hidden attribute sits on a bare wrapper: on the <p> itself a
    display utility of the prose classes (line-clamp) would outrank
    [hidden] and the sentence would show from the start. %>
<div hidden data-ticket-selection-target="note">
  <p class="<%= NeoFilterBarComponent::SENTENCE_PROSE_CLASSES %>"><%= t('views.organisations.tickets.selection.cleared_note') %></p>
</div>
